  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "plt_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -334
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Plotter pipeline\n\nGenerative plotter art, stage by stage. 1 · Contours' flow mode lays evenly spaced streamlines through a noise field, each line in one of three inks. 2 · Trim Path (`sequence`) draws them one after another as a pen would, the pen riding the drawing end (`heads`). An Integrate node is the plot's progress, 0 → 1: it runs at the plotter's speed, stops at 1 and starts over on Replot; the nib shows while it runs. 3 · Paper: a sheet with a soft shadow on the desk and film grain.\n\n• Sliders: `pen` width, line `spacing`, field `scale`, plot `speed`.  • Bang: Replot.\n• Toggle: clean output — just the finished lines on white, ready for File → Export PNG.\n• Vary: a new field.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Plotter pipeline\n\nGenerative plotter art, stage by stage. 1 · Contours' flow mode lays evenly spaced streamlines through a noise field, each line in one of three inks. 2 · Trim Path (`sequence`) draws them one after another as a pen would, the pen riding the drawing end (`heads`). An Integrate node is the plot's progress, 0 → 1: it runs at the plotter's speed, stops at 1 and starts over on Replot; the nib shows while it runs. 3 · Paper: a sheet with a soft shadow on the desk and film grain.\n\n• Sliders: `pen` width, line `spacing`, field `scale`, plot `speed`.  • Bang: Replot.\n• Toggle: clean output — just the finished lines on white, ready for File → Export PNG.\n• Vary: a new field.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
